WEBVTT

00:22:59.496 --> 00:23:02.413
X Rapid Evaluator. Is that a job?

00:23:02.954 --> 00:23:09.038
Is a job rapid evaluators at X? Our role
is to find new opportunities for X. .

00:23:09.038 --> 00:23:11.538
So what are the things X
should work on next?

00:23:11.746 --> 00:23:14.121
Are you a rapid evaluator in
other parts of your life?

00:23:14.621 --> 00:23:17.496
Do you just show up at a restaurant and
immediately know what to order?

00:23:19.538 --> 00:23:26.788
I think that a lot of my rapid evaluative
tendency is just consumed in my

00:23:26.788 --> 00:23:31.871
professional life so much that in my
personal life I'm like to my husband,